{"meta":{"id":"mqtt-structure","category":"it/server/backend/mqtt","title":"MQTT 통신 구조","subtitle":"","summary":"IoT MQTT 통신 구조를 간략하게 설명","tags":["mqtt","iot","통신"],"color":"orange","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-orange","source":"blog: code/back/Mqtt_Iot.jsx","updatedAt":"2025-01-21"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-orange-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 border border-orange-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>MQTT</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2025-01-21</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">MQTT 통신 구조</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-orange-50/70 border border-orange-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> IoT MQTT 통신 구조를 간략하게 설명</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">설치</p>\r\n<div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">node(v22.13.0), nvm(10.9.2)</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">mysql workbench ( community 8.0.40.0 )</span></div>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">(visual C++ 2019 설치버전 )</p>\r\n<div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">mosquitto (2.0.20)</span></div>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">내부 서버 구성</p>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 mb-1.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-bold text-stone-900\">1) Proxy Server : nginx</p>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 mb-1.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-bold text-stone-900\">2) Fornt-End :React</p>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 mb-1.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-bold text-stone-900\">3) Back-End :Express</p>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 mb-1.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-bold text-stone-900\">4) DB : MySQL</p>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 mb-1.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-bold text-stone-900\">5) MQTT Broker : mosquitto</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">통신 구조도</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 space-y-2 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/70 p-3 sm:p-4 overflow-x-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-orange-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">Device</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">IoT 기기</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold text-orange-600 leading-none mb-0.5\">MQTT</span><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-orange-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">MQTT Broker</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">mosquitto</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold text-orange-600 leading-none mb-0.5\">MQTT</span><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-orange-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">BackEnd</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">express</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-orange-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">nginx</span></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-orange-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">BackEnd</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">express</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-orange-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">Database</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">MySQL</span></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-orange-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">FrontEnd</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">React</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-orange-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">nginx</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold text-orange-600 leading-none mb-0.5\">Reverse Proxy</span><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-orange-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">Client</span></span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">MQTT Broker, BackEnd, Database, FrontEnd, nginx는 Server PC(노트북) 안에서 동작하고, Device와 Client는 외부에서 연결됩니다.</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/server/backend/mqtt/mqtt-structure","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"backend","title":"백엔드","path":"it/server/backend"},{"id":"mqtt","title":"MQTT (IoT)","path":"it/server/backend/mqtt"}],"hasImage":false}